<title>Mexico's cartel violence: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/mexico/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-mexico-2026-11-20T21:23:34.269Z</guid>
<pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 21:23:34 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The Sinaloa cartel is expanding attacks to U.S. rail companies, while a federal indictment named 21 alleged cartel members across Texas and Mexico. A $3.3 billion U.S.-Mexico counternarcotics aid program was reported as ineffective in reducing violence, and the Laredo port was cited in the same investigation. In Florida, law enforcement busted a drug cartel network, arresting the cartel boss and others. The conflict still produces low-level fatalities, with 37 battle-related deaths in 1996, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/live/2026/11/18/world/trump-xi-putin-apec/claudia-sheinbaum-mexico-flight-china-apec&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;KTLA&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;KEYE&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijAFBVV95cUxNMjhYTzJDcjFCZ2h0QnJkeE1iQUp2X2EwOXoxRG5fVnl6UGlLZHhhdEFyVUNSYS1lMkNHQTVqOTVjZHU1QTVGcE84QUpwLXVqaXN2OWtza0hnWjRYT19DRy1VcGViOHBCaGdSc1dqeUNobVdtN3psMFVZZEJCWnRsNTE1SGYxMl9EbTlrVA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Latin Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiogFBVV95cUxNSDcyV2lobDFDWm01T1Q2LXdzSnZxYVdoOW1FM1U2VExyMEhfc2JVeERIQW5lTzdjNGlQeGlrT0JTU1hHLVd3Y2owQkZmQkRtbXA2c0pvcHZibFR4SjdiWnJsdUhRZllOVkhkVkdHLTNuM3ZWVUVJa1pCRkxWd0QxdmhjRXBKakt6NWg0MVlQbzhtT3JpQzBna05JY3c3bnExbGc?oc=5&quot;&gt;KGNS&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMif0FVX3lxTE1zMWttT3VBLXpqYktQX3daR3JFUkhQb3JsZjB2Y2thcFNXbkNvVnFhNGg4NGhKbXRLQVhwalZjaGd0N1J6RWxQYnE1Z1N4QzBjd0hkUldPS2FXc3dRdDNmZ2NfeTlmNUtkR3A3NjdZajNFUWFSdzBicEFSaXFhOU0?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Denver Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.scmp.com/news/china/diplomacy/article/3375244/mexican-leader-sheinbaums-21-hour-economy-class-journey-draws-praise-china&quot;&